[[15,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the safety instructions\n(See 5040 - Precautions)</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[15,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the safety instructions\n(See 5040 - Precautions)</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant (\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428833\">0010T84</a>\n                                           ).</p><p><a href=\"#/2429732\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and disconnect the connector (1b ) for the\npipe from the condenser to the expansion valve.</p><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and disconnect the connector (2b) for the\npipe from the condenser to the compressor.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the disconnected connectors,\nusing suitable plugs, to prevent humidity and impurities from entering\nthe system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044920.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant (\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428833\">0010T84</a>\n                                           ).</p><p><a href=\"#/2429732\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and disconnect the connector (1b ) for the\npipe from the condenser to the expansion valve.</p><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and disconnect the connector (2b) for the\npipe from the condenser to the compressor.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the disconnected connectors,\nusing suitable plugs, to prevent humidity and impurities from entering\nthe system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052892.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the upper condenser fixing bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the condenser (2a) lowering it, after having released\nit from the lower retainers.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044921.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the upper condenser fixing bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the condenser (2a) lowering it, after having released\nit from the lower retainers.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052893.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>If necessary, remove the drier filter (refer\nto op. (5040A44))</p>"],[15,1,0,"<p>If necessary, remove the drier\nfilter (refer to op. (5040A44))</p>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the condenser is intact and\nis not damaged and does not have deposits of dirt on the finned\nsurface.</p><p>If removed, refit the drier filter (refer\nto op. (5040A44))</p><p>Place the condenser in position and attach\nit to the lower retainers.</p><p>Tighten the upper condenser fixing bolts.</p><p>1. Connect the connector (1a) for the pipe from the condenser to\nthe compressor and secure it by tightening the bolt (1b) to the\nrecommended torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings for the connectors.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Only use green coloured seals,\nresistant to R134A coolant fluid.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Lubricate the thread of the connectors\nusing anti-freeze.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the connector (2a) for the pipe from the condenser to\nthe expansion valve and secure it tightening the bolt (2b) to the\nrecommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044922.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the condenser is\nintact and is not damaged and does not have deposits of dirt on\nthe finned surface.</p><p>If removed, refit the drier filter (refer\nto op. (5040A44))</p><p>Place the condenser in position and attach\nit to the lower retainers.</p><p>Tighten the upper condenser fixing bolts.</p><p>1. Connect the connector (1a) for the pipe from the condenser to\nthe compressor and secure it by tightening the bolt (1b) to the\nrecommended torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings for the connectors.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Only use green coloured seals,\nresistant to R134A coolant fluid.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Lubricate the thread of the connectors\nusing anti-freeze.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the connector (2a) for the pipe from the condenser to\nthe expansion valve and secure it tightening the bolt (2b) to the\nrecommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052894.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2429732\">7210E10</a></p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428833\">0010T84</a>\n                                           ).</p>"],[15,1,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2429732\">7210E10</a></p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428833\">0010T84</a>\n                                           ).</p>"]]